 - give them a try if you haven't yet! 💋 HYPER DEEP THROAT {STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/46267827/e51c612feec8b02434fa19393807be1635ab67ba.jpg A 3D simulation focused on deep-throat play with a busty maid. The \"swirling piston system\" changes the motion in real time a","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-25T09:00:59Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114041484","verified_at":"2026-10-25T11:27:18Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5046600-1845383656392904","game_id":"steam-5046600","kind":"announcement","title":"SDT’s two new titles have each passed 2,500 wishlists!","summary":"Both of SDT’s new titles have passed 2,500 wishlists! About a month after hitting 1,000, thank you to everyone who added them! 🎮 Demos available from October 9! Demos for both titles will be available from October 9! Get an early taste before launch, and give them a try! 💋 HYPER DEEP THROAT {STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/46267827/e51c612feec8b02434fa19393807be1635ab67ba.jpg A 3D simulation focused on deep-throat play with a busty maid. The \"swirling piston system\" changes the motion in real time as you move","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-05T09:00:25Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1845383656392904","verified_at":"2026-10-20T21:02:26Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5046600-1842846814452567","game_id":"steam-5046600","kind":"announcement","title":"SDT's two new titles have each passed 1,000 wishlists!","summary":"Both of SDT's new titles have passed 1,000 wishlists! Thank you to everyone who added them. 💋 HYPER DEEP THROAT {STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/46267827/e51c612feec8b02434fa19393807be1635ab67ba.jpg A 3D simulation focused on deep-throat play with a busty maid. The \"swirling piston system\" changes the motion in real time as you move the mouse. Features 18 outfits, free customization of face, body and colors, plus a record & playback function. 🎅 BunnyGalSanta {STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/46267827/6d0728f90fc56a8a30c7c9f","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-07T09:00:07Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842846814452567","verified_at":"2026-10-20T21:02:26Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5046600-1841579228668361","game_id":"steam-5046600","kind":"announcement","title":"BunnyGalSanta releases on December 24","summary":"We're now publishing games by a new developer, SDT. The first one is BunnyGalSanta. It's a close-contact 3D simulation where you spend Christmas night with a girl in a bunny Santa outfit. The Neji-komi series is known for letting you control the thrusting in real time with your mouse stroke. BunnyGalSanta brings that system into 3D as the \"Guru-Guru Piston System\". Raise her satisfaction and new positions unlock. She's a Santa, so of course it launches on December 24. A wishlist helps us a lot.","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-21T11:00:29Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1841579228668361","verified_at":"2026-10-20T21:02:26Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-5046600":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T07:37:11Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T07:37:10Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-5046600":"2026-10-26T07:37:11Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"5046600":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T07:37:10Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T07:37:10Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T07:37:10Z"},"5228260":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T07:37:11Z","last_success_at":"20